{"format":"nexus-update-v1","version":"2.1.0","notes":"Natural voice for the orb: a free AI voice (Kokoro) that runs on your PC. Nexus downloads it once in the background (about 155 MB) and switches to it by itself; until then the Windows voice is used. Pick from 28 voices and test them in Settings > Assistant. Also fixes messages sent from the phone page not reaching the chat.","payload":"","signature":"ZusxB6v+zSkycsX+56oPK/CrXaAXHP4KzwLn1UNrl1jKlRLQXikgD1079EQ9TA2iPWoF/bXxiFMcgyKPGY1VDg=="}